  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Artifacts</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; </strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Backing up multiple artifacts (giving comma separated values without using all) is not supported right now. But, this can be achieved with a custom script with all the individual/specific backup commands.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"76cf4294-4325-49b3-b4eb-23903d41cb47\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This issue is fixed and will be working from release-0.89 onwards.Please refer the section Issues Fixed here <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Configure backup\" ri:version-at-save=\"41\" /></ac:link></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><strong>Postgres</strong></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Backing up and restoring a single db(eg openerp or openelis) is not supported right now.This can be achieved using the old way of backup and restore i.e. by creating a db dump.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/114895287"
      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Artifacts</strong></p><p><strong>    </strong>  Backing up multiple artifacts (giving comma separated values without using all) is not supported right now. But, this can be achieved with a custom script with all the individual/specific backup commands.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"76cf4294-4325-49b3-b4eb-23903d41cb47\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>This issue is fixed and will be working from release-0.89 onwards.Please refer the section Issues Fixed here <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114728763/Configure+backup\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114728763\" data-linked-resource-version=\"41\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure backup</a></p></div></div><p><strong>Postgres</strong></p><p>      Backing up and restoring a single db(eg openerp or openelis) is not supported right now.This can be achieved using the old way of backup and restore i.e. by creating a db dump.</p><p>       </p>",
      "representation": "view",
